- ConcreteSpec/Spec/Own.lean:267: `adoptDown` checks only that argument loans exist, so it can transfer the caller’s original loan instead of a fresh argument child. Entering an empty callee frame, adopting loan `0` from `Examples.exclusive`, and leaving ends the caller’s original mutable loan. Enforce the promised fresh-child restriction before changing activation ownership.
