  admission, existential package elaboration and concrete grant instances remain integration
  duties; these modules do not claim their checker correspondence. C6–C10 remain. C1 leaves to later slices'"''');s=s.replace('  (C5), the split of a request','  (C5 now supplies the instrumentation), the split of a request').replace('  storage can use C4\\'s hybrid state; C5 must still supply ownership instrumentation. Lifecycle','  storage can use C4\\'s hybrid state and C5\\'s ownership adapters. Lifecycle');open(p,'w').write(s)
p='ConcreteSpec/Spec.lean';s=open(p).read().replace('"'`Hybrid` (C4, structured places and stable materialized ranges). Each module'"\\'s header','"'`Hybrid` (C4, structured places and stable materialized ranges), `Own` (C5, ownership and loans),'"\\nand "'`Grant` (C5, brand lifetimes and grant attenuation). Each module'"\\'s header');open(p,'w').write(s)
